  "designs": {
    "components": "Original 128 MiB shared component workspace. Earlier five/six qualification in 2026-11-22-streett-workspace.json.",
    "dense-workspace": "Closed original enabledness, windowed above one million rows. Dense eight-byte original truth words and two u32 fields per cached product edge. Component allowance 512 MiB and at most 128 MiB across saved prefix columns at 8 GiB.",
